From 9a124572d4932ca8d36752895bff727a201e4695 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@buttzeppelin>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:37:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-230: undead male - exclude rule (a slot piece
 hidden beside a jaw / head wrap it does not fit: render, creator skip +
 revalidate, so the barber and old characters are covered), eyeglow eyerow (a
 player's eye row alone decides the glow, NPCs keep the stock facial-row glow
 via CharacterPreferences::m_zepNpc), ReplaceTexture ZEP_REPLACE_EYEGLOW (a
 glow eye replaces only *EyeGlow* type-0 textures, not the undead features
 atlas / goblin rag)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01URnr7tKsFMZq4VFsSKkj3S
